OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMild and humid to start, as a
OL,6,Fweakening band of rain moves
OL,7,Fsoutheast. Becoming drier, brighter
OL,8,Fand fresher later, with a breeze and
OL,9,Fsome warm sunny spells in the west and
OL,10,Fnorth.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear spells,
OL,13,Fthough more cloud in the north or west
OL,14,Fat times. Wind easing light inland but
OL,15,Fbreezy near the north Kent coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
