OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBright and dry through the
OL,6,Fmorning, more cloud developing during
OL,7,Fthe afternoon with isolated showers
OL,8,Fpossible in the far east, elsewhere
OL,9,Fshould remain dry. Moderate westerly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,14,Ftemperatures than of late. Often fine,
OL,15,Fespecially on Friday. Breezy at times,
OL,16,Fwith rain most likely on Thursday
OL,17,Fmorning and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
